REM shell_netinfo.duck [SKETCHY-LOOKING, HARMLESS] - opens a REAL terminal and
REM runs ipconfig, which only PRINTS this machine's network settings. Read-only,
REM changes nothing. Windows (Win+R cmd).
DELAY 800
GUI r
DELAY 600
STRINGLN cmd
DELAY 1400
DEFAULTDELAY 15
STRINGLN ipconfig
STRINGLN echo (read-only network info - nothing was changed)
